.TH FILE_WORD_COUNT 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
file_word_count \- count words in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int file_word_count(const char *" filename );
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B file_word_count()
function opens
.I filename
and counts the number of whitespace-separated words in it.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the word count on success, or \-1 if the file could not be opened.
.SH AUTHOR
Haseeb
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR file_line_count (3),
.BR file_search_pattern (3)
